  "details": "Honestly, you guys don't make reporting people easy for violations as is. But between the fact there's not enough categories in which to send one, not even an Other for unlisted stuff... it makes it hard to report anything.\n\nThere are so few actual things you can do to report someone breaking rules. Not enough to actually cover everything that's actually against the rules or someone making trouble for everyone.\n\nAnd even then, I have tried to report people who were straight out harassing me and causing me to go into PTSD attacks and nothing was done about the people. You make it easy for people to get away with whatever they want.",
